    "definition": "(1) An election to fill a vacancy caused by the expiration of the term shall be completed before the expiration. (2) An election to fill a vacancy caused by death, resignation, or removal shall be held within six months. (3) A person elected to fill a casual vacancy shall hold office for a full five-year term.",
